servation=<ObservationType.EDIT: 'edit'>, impl_source='oh_aci', diff='--- /workspace/link.txt\\n+++ /workspace/link.txt\\n@@ -1 +1 @@\\n-\\n+http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/JN3wM3goCJYKNBt', _diff_cache=None), CmdRunAction(command='cat /workspace/link.txt', is_input=False, thought='Now let me verify that the link.txt file has been created correctly and contains the share URL.', blocking=False, is_static=False, cwd=None, hidden=False, action=<ActionType.RUN: 'run'>, confirmation_state='confirmed', security_risk=None), CmdOutputObservation(content='http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/JN3wM3goCJYKNBt', command='cat /workspace/link.txt', observation=<ObservationType.RUN: 'run'>, metadata=CmdOutputMetadata(exit_code=0, pid=-1, username='root', hostname='ecs-d984', working_dir='/outputs', py_interpreter_path='/openhands/poetry/openhands-ai-5O4_aCHf-py3.12/bin/python', prefix='', suffix='\\n[The command completed with exit code 0.]'), hidden=False), CmdRunAction(command='head -20 /workspace/job_description.md', is_input=False, thought='Perfect! Let me also verify that the job_description.md file was created correctly by checking its content.', blocking=False, is_static=False, cwd=None, hidden=False, action=<ActionType.RUN: 'run'>, confirmation_state='confirmed', security_risk=None), CmdOutputObservation(content=\"# Software Development Engineer - New Grads\\n\\nThe Agent Company is an innovative software firm specializing in distributed systems, database technologies,\\nand artificial intelligence. Our core business includes developing and maintaining high-performance distributed graph databases,\\nstreaming databases, and providing advanced AI solutions.\\n\\nAt The Agent Company, we hire the best minds in technology to innovate and build on behalf of our customers. Our Software Development Engineers (SDEs) use cutting-edge technology to solve complex problems and get to see the impact of their work first-hand. The challenges SDEs solve for at The Agent Company are big and impact millions of customers, sellers, and products around the world. With a dedicated mentor and supportive team, you'll onboard quickly and start contributing to impactful projects soon after starting here at The Agent Company!\\n\\n## Key Responsibilities:\\n1. Work with a team to develop and extend The Agent Company's product\\n2. Design and build innovative technologies in a large distributed computing environment and help lead fundamental changes in the industry.\\n3. Create solutions to run predictions on distributed systems with exposure to innovative technologies at incredible scale and speed.\\n4. Own full software development lifecycle: design, development, testing, and operating in production\\n5. Build solutions with a high level of reliability, scalability, and security\\n\\n## Minimum Requirement:\\n1. Graduated less than 12 months ago or about to complete a Bachelor's or Master's Degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, or related fields at time of application\\n2. Programming experience in one or more programming languages (e.g., Python, C, C++, Java)\\n3. Knowledge of Computer Science fundamentals such as object-oriented design, algorithm design, data structures, problem solving and complexity analysis\\n4. Experience working with data structures or algorithms during coursework/projects, research, internships, or practical experience in school or work (e.g., open-source coding).\", command='head -20 /workspace/job_description.md', observation=<ObservationType.RUN: 'run'>, metadata=CmdOutputMetadata(exit_code=0, pid=-1, username='root', hostname='ecs-d984', working_dir='/outputs', py_interpreter_path='/openhands/poetry/openhands-ai-5O4_aCHf-py3.12/bin/python', prefix='', suffix='\\n[The command completed with exit code 0.]'), hidden=False), MCPAction(name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'UploadFileAndCreateShareLink', 'details': '# OwnCloud File Upload and Share Link Creation SOP\\n\\n## Overview\\nThis SOP describes how to upload a file to OwnCloud and create a public share link for it when browser-based upload methods fail.\\n\\n## Steps\\n\\n### 1. Upload File via WebDAV\\nWhen browser upload fails due to hidden file inputs, use curl with WebDAV:\\n```bash\\ncurl -u username:password -T /path/to/local/file \"http://owncloud-server/remote.php/webdav/Documents/filename.md\"\\n```\\n\\n### 2. Create Share Link via API\\nUse the OwnCloud sharing API to create a public share link:\\n```bash\\ncurl -u username:password -X POST \\\\\\n  \"http://owncloud-server/ocs/v2.php/apps/files_sharing/api/v1/shares\" \\\\\\n  -H \"OCS-APIRequest: true\" \\\\\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" \\\\\\n  -d \"path=/Documents/filename.md&shareType=3&permissions=1\"\\n```\\n\\n### 3. Extract Share URL\\nThe API response will contain a share URL in the `<url>` tag. Save this URL to a file.\\n\\n## Parameters\\n- `shareType=3`: Creates a public link share\\n- `permissions=1`: Read-only permissions\\n\\n## Verification\\n- Check file upload: `curl -u username:password \"http://owncloud-server/remote.php/webdav/Documents/filename.md\" -I`\\n- The share URL format: `http://owncloud-server/index.php/s/{token}`\\n\\n## Notes\\n- This method works when browser automation fails due to hidden file inputs\\n- The share link allows anyone with the URL to access the file\\n- Files are uploaded to the specified directory (e.g., Documents)'}, thought='Excellent! Now let me save the SOP for this OwnCloud operation since I successfully completed the task.', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Successfully saved new guide \\'UploadFileAndCreateShareLink\\' for platform \\'ownCloud\\'.\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'UploadFileAndCreateShareLink', 'details': '# OwnCloud File Upload and Share Link Creation SOP\\n\\n## Overview\\nThis SOP describes how to upload a file to OwnCloud and create a public share link for it when browser-based upload methods fail.\\n\\n## Steps\\n\\n### 1. Upload File via WebDAV\\nWhen browser upload fails due to hidden file inputs, use curl with WebDAV:\\n```bash\\ncurl -u username:password -T /path/to/local/file \"http://owncloud-server/remote.php/webdav/Documents/filename.md\"\\n```\\n\\n### 2. Create Share Link via API\\nUse the OwnCloud sharing API to create a public share link:\\n```bash\\ncurl -u username:password -X POST \\\\\\n  \"http://owncloud-server/ocs/v2.php/apps/files_sharing/api/v1/shares\" \\\\\\n  -H \"OCS-APIRequest: true\" \\\\\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" \\\\\\n  -d \"path=/Documents/filename.md&shareType=3&permissions=1\"\\n```\\n\\n### 3. Extract Share URL\\nThe API response will contain a share URL in the `<url>` tag. Save this URL to a file.\\n\\n## Parameters\\n- `shareType=3`: Creates a public link share\\n- `permissions=1`: Read-only permissions\\n\\n## Verification\\n- Check file upload: `curl -u username:password \"http://owncloud-server/remote.php/webdav/Documents/filename.md\" -I`\\n- The share URL format: `http://owncloud-server/index.php/s/{token}`\\n\\n## Notes\\n- This method works when browser automation fails due to hidden file inputs\\n- The share link allows anyone with the URL to access the file\\n- Files are uploaded to the specified directory (e.g., Documents)'}), AgentFinishAction(final_thought='\\nTask completed successfully! Here\\'s a summary of what was accomplished:\\n\\n1. **Created Job Description**: Merged the template.md and requirement.txt files to create a comprehensive job description for a Software Development Engineer - New Grad position.\\n\\n2. **Uploaded to OwnCloud**: Successfully uploaded the job_description.md file to the Documents directory